{"id": "fu_00", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_c30232660d04", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_79ec25a296ba", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "留存率是用户在安装软件后持续使用它的比例，用来衡量产品粘性和用户满意度。", "summary": "留存率 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_647bce0eeb59", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "付费率是指用户在安装软件后实际完成付费操作的比例，用于衡量产品的商业转化效率。", "summary": "付费率 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_01", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_f3b1a3ea4984", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_1337c2204a0c", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "深度转化是用户在被广告触达后，经过多次互动，最终完成核心目标行为，比如付费或注册成功。", "summary": "深度转化 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_015ce9d6ce9e", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "浅层转化是用户刚被广告接触到时的简单行为，比如点击或打开应用，还没到完成关键目标阶段。", "summary": "浅层转化 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_02", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_2b191e34bbef", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_9cdae5e7ef39", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "跑量就是让广告在预算允许的范围内尽可能多转化和消耗资源。", "summary": "跑量 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_4ccffde71637", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "跑不动说明当前出价或预算已达到上限，需调整策略或提高投放规模。", "summary": "跑不动 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_03", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_e2899e188454", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_980667c95d42", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "CPM是千次曝光收费，按广告展示次数计费，常用于衡量推广曝光效果。", "summary": "CPM 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_3771af1ba2eb", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "CPC是每次点击收费，按用户实际点击次数计费，常见于精准定向推广场景。", "summary": "CPC 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_04", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_4db0411a76e6", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_808784544fbb", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "再营销是指在广告计划中途暂停投放后，继续围绕当时已展示过广告的用户或近期曾接触到产品的人群进行精准推送，旨在提高转化效率。", "summary": "再营销 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_f022e409e203", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "留存用户的概率比吸引新用户更高，所以我们会优先保障老用户的持续参与。", "summary": "留存 优先于 拉新", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_05", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_371b08c35b60", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_bc32c6463e37", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "留存曲线是看用户在安装软件后，持续使用产品的比例变化，帮助我们了解用户留存情况。", "summary": "留存曲线 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_34ca71d81064", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "次留比七留更重要，因为次留影响后续转化和活跃，是衡量短期效果的关键指标。", "summary": "次留 > 七留", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_06", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_5968902dfe4a", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_cba47261be22", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "出价策略就是决定我们在竞价时该出多少钱的规则，它影响着我们能接到多少广告和花费多少钱。", "summary": "出价策略 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_523bb46c71bd", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "手动出价灵活但费力，适合预算小、想精准控价的情况；自动出价省心省力，适合追求效率和规模化投放的场景。", "summary": "手动 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_07", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_18be39463703", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_5c78d54799ac", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "CPI是每次安装所花费的平均成本，用来衡量推广花费与安装量之间的关系。", "summary": "CPI 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_19a5baffba23", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "LTV是用户一生能为公司带来多少钱，用来指导如何合理投入广告预算。", "summary": "LTV 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_08", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_a1fd1c992d4a", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_fc71b9d23c46", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "reject", "reply": "素材疲劳是指近期计划效率持续低于预期，可能是因素材创意重复或受众注意力已过熟导致。", "summary": "素材疲劳 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_37831270f806", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "频次是指用户看到同一素材或广告的次数，过高可能导致反感，需结合投放时段和目标群体合理设定。", "summary": "频次 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_09", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_471d5439a847", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_63eaf1ff2962", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "自然量是指通过内容本身吸引来的流量，不需要花钱去推广。", "summary": "自然量 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_e4f159110632", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "买量就是花钱买流量，通过广告直接吸引目标用户打开App。", "summary": "买量 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_10", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_1bee4d717c9f", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_7953945e59d8", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "CTR是点击次数除以曝光次数得到的指标，用于衡量素材的吸引力和有效性。", "summary": "CTR 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_be37f1fa840d", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "CVR是用户点击链接后完成预期目标（如下载、注册）的比例。", "summary": "CVR 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_11", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_2937d9abb5b4", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_0a3570179d56", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "大盘就是整个市场或平台的整体情况，包括流量、价格和供需变化，用来分析整体趋势和制定策略。", "summary": "大盘 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_5562440380a3", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "tool_call", "reply": "细分市场是大盘中进一步细分的需求群体，如按地域、兴趣或使用场景划分的目标用户群。", "summary": "细分市场 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_12", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_a72e00aad1c2", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_356f865d2c8d", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "起量阶段是计划刚上线时的摸索期，消耗和转化都在快速增长，但波动较大，需持续观察调整。", "summary": "起量 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_ffc471dd88c2", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "tool_call", "reply": "CMP_2 的消耗和转化都比较低，可能需要进一步调整投放策略。", "summary": "CMP_2 起量 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [{"tool": "campaign.get_metrics", "arguments": "{\"campaign_id\": \"CMP_2\"}"}], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_13", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_7a0d8e9eb447", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_6628b9a96a92", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "A/B 测试是通过让相同人群看到不同版本的素材，观察大家的点击和安装效果差异，来判断哪个版本表现更好。", "summary": "A/B 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_8fb9a876e8b2", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "增量测试是通过比较新旧版本在同一批人中的效果差异，来验证新版本是否真的带来了可量化的提升。", "summary": "增量测试 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_14", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_8ab57aa485ac", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_c07bf06c6ace", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "素材衰退是指老素材效果持续走低，已无法支撑有效投放的阶段。", "summary": "素材衰退 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_65842041b5c2", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "正常是指数据已收敛、指标稳定且无异常波动。", "summary": "正常 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_15", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_98fa08cb518d", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_a9e82199eabf", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "防作弊是通过程序检测和拦截异常行为，防止虚假刷量、恶意注册和刷量广告等违规操作的统称。", "summary": "防作弊 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_9264fc6cdbfe", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "作弊就是用技术手段制造虚假流量，比如用脚本自动刷量、虚假点击，或者冒充真实用户来骗钱。", "summary": "作弊 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_16", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_72429a9ac4a6", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_67bfdffa1331", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "频次是指同一人看到同一素材的次数，如果频次过高，可能意味着素材被重复推送或目标群体过于集中。", "summary": "频次 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_6e6e6adcf13e", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "频次高说明同一素材被大量重复推送，可能造成用户疲劳，需注意投放策略调整。", "summary": "频次 高 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_17", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_0080e090e535", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_284a8b272148", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "ROI是投资回报率，等于收益除以成本，用来衡量投入每元能带来多少收入。", "summary": "ROI 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_965045191a2c", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "ROAS是广告投放的收益分成，等于广告收入除以广告花费，用来衡量每块钱广告费能带来多少收入。", "summary": "ROAS 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_18", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_b8d777cc5c0d", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_243e36b1c74c", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "冷启动是指新计划刚上线时，平台还来不及把数据说给算法听，这时候的效果数据还不准，得等它慢慢学会怎么帮你选人。", "summary": "冷启动 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_f86d2931f1a4", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "学习期是指新计划刚上线时，平台还在学习阶段，数据还不稳定，效果可能还没完全发挥出来。", "summary": "学习期 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_19", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_a7f1c6107691", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_1abe1926c6b8", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "竞价是广告竞价决定哪条广告能出现在前面，出价越高，广告就越容易被展示出来。", "summary": "竞价 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_da89c3b94f82", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "预算平滑是指系统会均匀使用预算，而不是在月初一次性用完，留到月中再补上。", "summary": "预算平滑 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_20", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_34dee2e1b671", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_d3d1982c78e6", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "混合变现就是把广告和买量一起用，让钱从不同的地方来，这样收入更稳。", "summary": "混合变现 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_c8dac1bd84c4", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "买量投放就是直接花钱买到精准用户看了广告，和靠内容让别人主动来看不太一样。", "summary": "买量 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
